abstract: >
  EpiProfile_PLANTS is a plant-oriented, auditable and reproducible extension of EpiProfile 2.0
  for screening histone-derived peptides (hDPs), histone peptideforms (hPFs) and histone PTMs (hPTMs)
  from bottom-up LC–MS/MS data following anhydride derivatization protocols. The repository provides
  standalone, species-specific bundles (e.g., Arabidopsis, Marchantia, Chlamydomonas, Physcomitrella)
  that run with the same EpiProfile entrypoint, while maintaining transparent provenance and a function-level
  audit (T1–T4 tiers).

